{"seq":2,"slug":"dose-response-window","title":"量效关系与治疗窗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/foundations/dose-response-window","wordCount":1616,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"量效关系与治疗窗\">量效关系与治疗窗</h1><p>华法林是临床最难掌控的药物之一：剂量稍低，血栓风险卷土重来；稍高，患者就可能颅内出血。这种「安全区间窄得像走钢丝」的特性，正是量效关系与治疗窗要回答的问题——多大的剂量产生多大的效应，又在哪个剂量开始从「治疗」滑向「中毒」。把药开对，本质上是在一条曲线上找准落点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量效关系（dose-response relationship）描述药物剂量与其效应强度之间的定量联系。它有两种画法：<strong>分级量效曲线</strong>（graded）针对单一个体或组织，纵轴是效应的连续强度（如血压下降毫米汞柱）；<strong>质反应量效曲线</strong>（quantal）针对一个群体，纵轴是「产生某个全或无效应（如入睡、死亡）的个体百分比」。两者形状都呈 S 形（在对数剂量坐标下），但解读完全不同。</p>\n<p>从分级曲线能读出两个关键参数：<strong>效价强度</strong>（potency，曲线沿横轴的位置，越靠左越强效）与<strong>效能</strong>（efficacy，曲线平台的高度，即最大可达效应）。这两者常被混淆，但临床意义截然不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[给药剂量] --&gt; B[分级量效曲线&lt;br/&gt;个体效应强度]&#10;  A --&gt; C[质反应量效曲线&lt;br/&gt;群体反应百分比]&#10;  B --&gt; D[效价强度 EC50&lt;br/&gt;曲线横向位置]&#10;  B --&gt; E[效能 Emax&lt;br/&gt;平台高度]&#10;  C --&gt; F[ED50&lt;br/&gt;半数有效量]&#10;  C --&gt; G[TD50/LD50&lt;br/&gt;半数中毒/致死量]&#10;  F --&gt; H[治疗指数 TI&lt;br/&gt;= TD50 / ED50]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{TI 大?}&#10;  I --&gt;|宽治疗窗| J[相对安全]&#10;  I --&gt;|窄治疗窗| K[需血药监测]\">flowchart TD\n  A[给药剂量] --&gt; B[分级量效曲线&lt;br/&gt;个体效应强度]\n  A --&gt; C[质反应量效曲线&lt;br/&gt;群体反应百分比]\n  B --&gt; D[效价强度 EC50&lt;br/&gt;曲线横向位置]\n  B --&gt; E[效能 Emax&lt;br/&gt;平台高度]\n  C --&gt; F[ED50&lt;br/&gt;半数有效量]\n  C --&gt; G[TD50/LD50&lt;br/&gt;半数中毒/致死量]\n  F --&gt; H[治疗指数 TI&lt;br/&gt;= TD50 / ED50]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{TI 大?}\n  I --&gt;|宽治疗窗| J[相对安全]\n  I --&gt;|窄治疗窗| K[需血药监测]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>反映</th>\n<th>临床含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EC50</td>\n<td>产生半数最大效应的浓度</td>\n<td>效价强度</td>\n<td>越小越强效，但不代表更好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Emax</td>\n<td>最大可达效应</td>\n<td>效能</td>\n<td>决定药物「天花板」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ED50</td>\n<td>半数个体有效的剂量</td>\n<td>群体疗效</td>\n<td>用于剂量设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TD50</td>\n<td>半数个体中毒的剂量</td>\n<td>群体毒性</td>\n<td>与 ED50 对比看安全性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治疗指数 TI</td>\n<td>TD50 / ED50（或 LD50/ED50）</td>\n<td>安全裕度</td>\n<td>越大越安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"效价与效能-别再混为一谈\">效价与效能：别再混为一谈</h2><p>一个常见误解是「效价强度越高的药越好」。事实并非如此。布洛芬效价低于吗啡（需更大剂量才止痛），但对轻中度疼痛足够且更安全；这里更高的效价毫无优势。效价强度仅决定「用多大剂量」，临床上只要剂量可行，低效价完全不是缺点——区别只是吃 5 mg 还是 500 mg。</p>\n<p>真正要紧的是效能。如果药 A 的 Emax 高于药 B，那么无论怎么加量，药 B 都无法达到药 A 的最大效应。对乙酰氨基酚（扑热息痛）与阿片类的镇痛效能差距，就是再大剂量的扑热息痛也压不住剧痛的原因。理解这一点，才能在「换更强效的药」与「换更高效能的药」之间做对选择。这种效能差异的分子根源，与药物的内在活性直接相关，见 <a href=\"drug-action-receptors\">药物作用与受体</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治疗指数与治疗窗\">治疗指数与治疗窗</h2><p>治疗指数（therapeutic index, TI）是衡量安全裕度的经典指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TI = \\frac{TD_{50}}{ED_{50}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>TI 越大，「有效」与「中毒」剂量离得越远，用药越宽松。青霉素的 TI 极高（过敏除外可大剂量给药），而地高辛、华法林、锂盐、茶碱、氨基糖苷类的 TI 很窄——这类「窄治疗窗药物」（NTI drugs）必须做<strong>治疗药物监测</strong>（TDM），定期抽血测血药浓度来微调剂量。</p>\n<p>但 TI 用群体的「半数」剂量做比值，掩盖了曲线两端的离散度。更保守的指标是<strong>确定安全裕度</strong>（certain safety factor）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>安全裕度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>99</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{安全裕度} = \\frac{TD_{1}}{ED_{99}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">安全裕度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">99</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即「让 1% 的人中毒的剂量」除以「让 99% 的人有效的剂量」。这个比值若小于 1，说明在让绝大多数人有效之前，就已有人开始中毒——比单看 TI 揭示的风险严峻得多。给药方案如何利用这些参数维持血药浓度落在治疗窗内，详见 <a href=\"../pharmacokinetics/half-life-dosing\">半衰期与给药方案</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"个体差异如何撑宽或挤窄曲线\">个体差异如何撑宽或挤窄曲线</h2><p>量效曲线画的是「平均人」，但真实患者千差万别。同一剂量在不同个体间的反应差异可达上千倍——这源于体重、年龄、肝肾功能、遗传多态性、合并用药等。CYP2C9 慢代谢者用标准剂量华法林，体内浓度可能高出数倍，治疗窗实际上被「挤窄」到危险地步。</p>\n<p>这意味着固定剂量本质上是一种妥协。现代趋势是<strong>基于体重/体表面积给药</strong>（尤其儿科与肿瘤化疗）、<strong>药物基因组学指导给药</strong>（如根据 CYP2C19 基因型调整氯吡格雷），以及对窄治疗窗药物的常规 TDM。这些个体化策略的机制与证据，在 <a href=\"../pharmacodynamics/tolerance-variability\">耐受依赖与个体差异</a> 中系统展开；而把曲线落点偏移的代谢因素，则见 <a href=\"../pharmacokinetics/metabolism-excretion\">代谢与排泄</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区与权衡\">常见误区与权衡</h2><p>量效关系里有几个直觉陷阱，直接影响用药判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>常见误区</th>\n<th>为什么错</th>\n<th>正确理解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>效价越高药越好</td>\n<td>效价只决定「用多大剂量」</td>\n<td>决定天花板的是效能（Emax）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TI 越大幅度越安全</td>\n<td>TI 用「半数」剂量比值，掩盖曲线两端离散</td>\n<td>需结合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>99</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TD_1/ED_{99}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">99</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等更保守指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治疗窗是固定值</td>\n<td>同一药在不同个体身上窗宽不同</td>\n<td>基因型、肝肾功能会撑宽或挤窄它</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剂量加倍效应加倍</td>\n<td>S 形曲线中段敏感、两端迟钝</td>\n<td>曲线平台期加量只会增加毒性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践上的权衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>换「更强效的药」与换「更高效能的药」是两回事，前者只是改变剂量刻度，后者才改变疗效上限。</li>\n<li>对窄治疗窗药物，宁可多测血药浓度，也不要凭症状猜测——TDM 的成本远低于中毒的代价。</li>\n<li>个体化给药（体重、基因型）不是「锦上添花」，而是让治疗窗真实落在安全区的必要手段。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>量效关系分「分级」（个体效应强度）与「质反应」（群体反应百分比）两类曲线，对数剂量下均呈 S 形。</li>\n<li>效价强度（EC50/横向位置）与效能（Emax/平台高度）是两回事——高效价不等于好药，效能决定天花板。</li>\n<li>治疗指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TI = TD_{50}/ED_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量安全裕度；窄治疗窗药物（华法林、地高辛、锂盐等）必须做治疗药物监测。</li>\n<li>更保守的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>99</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TD_1/ED_{99}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">99</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 安全裕度揭示 TI 掩盖的曲线离散风险。</li>\n<li>个体差异可把治疗窗实际挤窄到危险地步，推动按体重、基因型给药与 TDM——详见 <a href=\"../pharmacodynamics/tolerance-variability\">耐受依赖与个体差异</a> 与 <a href=\"../pharmacokinetics/half-life-dosing\">半衰期与给药方案</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"量效关系与治疗窗","id":"量效关系与治疗窗"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"效价与效能：别再混为一谈","id":"效价与效能-别再混为一谈"},{"level":2,"text":"治疗指数与治疗窗","id":"治疗指数与治疗窗"},{"level":2,"text":"个体差异如何撑宽或挤窄曲线","id":"个体差异如何撑宽或挤窄曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区与权衡","id":"常见误区与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"药物作用与受体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/foundations/drug-action-receptors"},"next":{"title":"药物分类概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/foundations/drug-classification"}}